      "id": "claim_58f33d538da64d13acce24f0528c7623",
      "statement": "The sandbox is a nested isolation stack: a sandboxed iframe (sandbox=allow-scripts allow-same-origin) that is a thin relay, a dedicated Worker (sandbox-worker.js) where all CheerpJ compile/run happens, and the CheerpJ JVM-in-WASM inside the Worker.",
