      "id": "claim_d33a5212c3a64f8dbe8602a9b2df37ce",
      "statement": "The iframe uses allow-same-origin because CheerpJ needs same-origin access to its own worker/caching machinery; combined with the static ban list blocking java.io/java.net/java.nio before compilation, the JVM-in-WASM has no host filesystem or OS-process access, and any network access is limited to the browser's fetch/XHR stack with no raw sockets.",
