      "id": "claim_f460b0ae2ae94d328267afac4fb80b5d",
      "statement": "Two budgets govern a run: INIT_BUDGET_MS=90s in runner.ts covers loading+compiling (the slow first CheerpJ load per session), and the kata's timeoutMs (default 5000) covers the run phase; both runner.ts and sandbox.js reset their budget timer to timeoutMs when the sandbox reports the running phase, so per-kata timeout does not count against variable load+compile time.",
