      "statement": "A fresh iframe is created per run with no CheerpJ session reuse; teardown after every run avoids the JVM classloader serving a stale Main/KataRunner class from a previous run under the same class names, and the documented upgrade path is to reuse the iframe once CheerpJ per-call class reloading is confirmed safe.",
