      "id": "claim_e58b1c3790da4115920390c1f762fcab",
      "statement": "There is no enforceable memory cap; the timeout plus worker.terminate()/iframe-teardown is the only backstop against a runaway submission, and one that allocates aggressively but finishes within its timeout is not stopped early.",
