    {
      "id": "claim_078e3e4e759d4bde9ba69183e4542483",
      "statement": "Live locked-region enforcement in src/editor/editor.ts is a CodeMirror 6 StateField + transaction filter: locked ranges are recomputed from the template segments and remapped through every doc change via mapPos (boundary insertions push the range edges outward so the locked text never drifts), while the transaction filter blocks any change overlapping the interior of a locked range and permits insertions exactly at a boundary. This is a UX convenience only — the pre-run validateLocked re-check is what makes the locked regions security-relevant.",
